# OpenAPI Generator's oneOf template emits invalid Java when a variant is a
# parameterized type (e.g. Map<String, Object>, List<FeelValue>). Both of
# these schemas hit that bug. We hand-write minimal stubs in
# src/main/java/com/quantumbpm/client/generated/model/ that other generated
# models reference as plain POJO field types - Jackson handles the
# serialization transparently.
**/model/FeelValue.java
**/model/CorrelationKeys.java
